OL,3,GNEWSAGunman shot his own accomplice in
OL,4,Abotched attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who police say botched a
OL,7,Fplanned shooting after one of them
OL,8,Faccidentally shot the other have been
OL,9,Fjailed.
OL,11,FAdam Liaqat and Asad Khan were parked
OL,12,Fup when their gun went off in St Paul's
OL,13,FRoad, Smethwick, at just before 04:30
OL,14,FGMT on 23 November last year, the West
OL,15,FMidlands force said.
OL,17,FLiaqat, the driver, fired the gun by
OL,18,Fmistake, leaving accomplice Khan with
OL,19,Fserious leg injuries, it added.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
