OL,3,GNEWSAGunman shot his own accomplice in
OL,4,Abotched attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiaqat and Khan, who were convicted of
OL,7,Fpossession of a firearm with intent to
OL,8,Fendanger life, have been sentenced to
OL,9,F15 years and 13 years respectively.
OL,10,FAnother man, Yakuba Sawaneh, has been
OL,11,Fjailed for three-and-a-half years.
